  "referenceNumber": "RUS1048",
  "remarks": "\nAnatoly Anatolyevich SERYSHEV is a Member of the Security Council of the Russian Federation and Presidential Envoy to the Siberian Federal District. As a Member of the Security Council, SERYSHEV is or has been responsible for, engaged in, provided support for or promoted policies or actions which destabilise Ukraine and undermine or threaten the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine.\n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023.",
